    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d504">

                <pb facs="0644" n="330" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg330"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-27">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">October 27, 1914</hi>.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>504. Department’s telegram, October 9, regarding cargoes on vessels destroyed by
                    German cruisers. Interested persons represent to Department German Government’s
                    position this matter has important effect on questions relating to insurance.
                    Endeavor obtain early reply from German Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
